BT 1 0 0 1 0 96.3 Tm 10.5 TL /F2 8.7 Tf .098039 .152941 .2 rg (Realsock Radar workflow:) Tj /F1 8.7 Tf  T* (1. ) Tj /F2 8.7 Tf (Detect:) Tj /F1 8.7 Tf ( monitor and classify an event; retain source and confidence.) Tj  T* (2. ) Tj /F2 8.7 Tf (Connect:) Tj /F1 8.7 Tf ( traverse the context graph to routes, suppliers, materials and project milestones.) Tj  T* (3. ) Tj /F2 8.7 Tf (Simulate:) Tj /F1 8.7 Tf ( compare normal, watch and adverse ranges across cost, delivery and cash flow.) Tj  T* (4. ) Tj /F2 8.7 Tf (Explain:) Tj /F1 8.7 Tf ( reveal every link, assumption, conflict and supporting source.) Tj  T* (5. ) Tj /F2 8.7 Tf (Act:) Tj /F1 8.7 Tf ( assign an owner, due date and trigger for quote, substitute, contingency or reforecast.) Tj  T*  T* /F2 8.7 Tf (Housing Purchase Capacity Index \(base = 100\)) Tj /F1 8.7 Tf ( translates the selected scenario into three visible channels:) Tj T* -0.089955 Tw (new-dwelling cost, mortgage repayment pressure and settlement timing. The implementation uses Semantica-style context) Tj T* 0 Tw (graphs and deterministic paths, not a black-box score.) Tj T* ET
