BT 1 0 0 1 0 54.3 Tm 10.5 TL /F2 8.7 Tf .098039 .152941 .2 rg (Why this is different:) Tj /F1 8.7 Tf ( news platforms flag an event; property dashboards report lagging outcomes; black-box tools output a risk score. ) Tj /F2 8.7 Tf (Realsock Radar connects the three:) Tj /F1 8.7 Tf ( live signal -) Tj (> named) Tj T* (project exposure -) Tj (> transparent simulation -) Tj (> assigned action. Its purchase-capacity index makes the household-facing implication legible without pretending to forecast house prices: ) Tj /F2 8.7 Tf (100 =) Tj T* (baseline; lower values mean a scenario makes a new home less affordable through cost, repayments or settlement timing.) Tj /F1 8.7 Tf  T*  T* /F2 8.7 Tf (Business outcome to test:) Tj /F1 8.7 Tf ( faster exposure verification, fewer unsupported alerts, earlier quote/substitution decisions, clearer lender/supplier communication and documented contingency) Tj T* (choices. Funding delivers a low-cost, mobile-ready, explainable planning product for Australian housing projects.) Tj T* ET
